{"sha": "265f351819361b39cf188a48e1e9f0974b67c93a933f82819ae029e606d7d571", "body": ["\\begin{example}[碳，实测]\\label{ex:b3:many-electron-atoms:carbon}", "% ledger: lev:C.3P1, lev:C.3P2, lev:C.1D2, lev:C.1S0", "碳的基态组态 $2p^2$ 给出能级 \\termsym{3}{P}{0}，", "\\termsym{3}{P}{1}、\\termsym{3}{P}{2} 分别位于 0、16.4 和 \\qty{43.4}{cm^{-1}}，随后", "\\termsym{1}{D}{2} 位于 \\qty{10193}{cm^{-1}}，\\termsym{1}{S}{0} 位于", "\\qty{21648}{cm^{-1}}：${}^3$P 项最低，与洪特规则的预言相符。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[name=main, width=0.62\\linewidth, height=6.4cm, xmin=-0.3, xmax=6.6,", "  ymin=-1500, ymax=23500, axis y line=left, axis x line=none,", "  ylabel={能量 / cm$^{-1}$}, unbounded coords=jump, clip=false,", "  scaled y ticks=false, ytick={0,10000,20000},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omstate] table[x=x, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-atomic-levels-carbon.dat};", "\\draw[densely dotted, gray] (axis cs:1,4858.5) -- (axis cs:2,29.6);", "\\draw[densely dotted, gray] (axis cs:1,4858.5) -- (axis cs:2,10192.7);", "\\draw[densely dotted, gray] (axis cs:1,4858.5) -- (axis cs:2,21648);", "\\draw[densely dotted, gray] (axis cs:3,10192.7) -- (axis cs:4,10192.7);", "\\draw[densely dotted, gray] (axis cs:3,21648) -- (axis cs:4,21648);", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:0.5,4858.5) {$2p^2$};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:2.5,21648) {${}^1$S};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:2.5,10192.7) {${}^1$D};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:2.5,29.6) {${}^3$P};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:5.05,21648) {\\termsym{1}{S}{0}};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:5.05,10192.7) {\\termsym{1}{D}{2}};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:0.5,-600) {组态};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:2.5,-600) {项};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:4.5,-600) {能级};", "\\draw[gray, ->] (axis cs:3.05,60) -- (axis cs:6.9,2500);", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[at={(main.south east)}, anchor=south west, xshift=1.2cm, yshift=0.9cm,", "  width=3.6cm, height=3.6cm, xmin=-0.1, xmax=1.1, ymin=-5, ymax=50,", "  axis y line=right, axis x line=none, unbounded coords=jump, ytick={0,16.4,43.4},", "  yticklabels={0,16.4,43.4}, tick label style={font=\\scriptsize}, clip=false,", "  title={\\scriptsize ${}^3$P，放大图}, title style={yshift=-4pt}]", "\\addplot[omstate] table[x=x, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-atomic-levels-carbon-zoom.dat};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:0,0) {$J = 0$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:0,16.4) {$J = 1$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:0,43.4) {$J = 2$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 碳的基态组态：一个组态，三个项", "（各项取实测能量；${}^3$P 项取其各能级的加权平均，", "组态取全部十五个态的平均值），以及五个", "能级。${}^3$P 项的自旋–轨道分裂（放大图，单位为", "\\unit{cm^{-1}}）比项与项之间的", "间距小几百倍。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{洪特规则与自旋–轨道耦合}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[项的洪特规则]\\label{prop:b3:many-electron-atoms:hund-terms}", "对原子或离子的基态组态，能量最低的项是", "满足（1）$S$ 最大，再在该 $S$ 下（2）$L$ 最大的那一项。其最低", "能级满足（3）：不足半满时 $J = |L - S|$，超过半满时 $J = L +", "S$。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\begin{proof}[地位]", "这些规则由实验确立，仅适用于基态组态；", "它们并非定理。规则 1 即上一", "节所述的交换稳定化；规则 2 指自旋同向的电子", "相遇较少；规则 3 由下文自旋–轨道耦合的符号得出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[由轨道框图求基态项]\\label{met:b3:many-electron-atoms:ground-term}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 自 $m_l = +l$ 起向下填充开壳层的各轨道框，", "        每框先填一个自旋平行的电子，再从 $+l$ 起配对。", "  \\item $S = \\frac12 \\times$（未成对电子数）；$L = |\\sum m_l|$。", "  \\item 不足半满时 $J = |L - S|$，超过半满时 $L + S$；", "        恰好半满时 $L = 0$ 且 $J = S$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[基态项]\\label{ex:b3:many-electron-atoms:ground-terms}", "% ledger: lev:Ti2.3P0, lev:Ni2.3P0, lev:Cr3.4P1_2", "\\ce{Ti^2+}，$d^2$：$m_l = 2, 1$ 两个轨道框已填，$S = 1$，$L = 3$，$J = 2$：", "\\termsym{3}{F}{2}。\\ce{Cr^3+}，$d^3$：$S = \\frac32$，$L = 2 + 1 + 0 = 3$，", "\\termsym{4}{F}{3/2}。\\ce{Fe^2+}，$d^6$：$m_l = 2$ 处五个自旋向上、一个向下，", "$S = 2$，$L = 2$，超过半满，\\termsym{5}{D}{4}。\\ce{Ni^2+}，$d^8$：", "$S = 1$，$L = 3$，\\termsym{3}{F}{4}。所得结果均与原子光谱", "测得的基态能级一致。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{definition}[自旋–轨道耦合，精细结构]\\label{def:b3:many-electron-atoms:spin-orbit}", "称\\emph{自旋–轨道耦合}\\index{自旋–轨道耦合}为", "电子自旋磁矩与其轨道运动磁矩之间的相互作用，", "对某一项记为 $A\\,\\hat{\\mathbf L}\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf S}/\\hbar^2$。它", "将一个项按不同的 $J$ 分裂为各能级，该项的\\emph{精细", "结构}\\index{精细结构}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[朗德间隔定则]\\label{prop:b3:many-electron-atoms:lande}", "在同一项内，$E(J) = E_0 + \\frac{A}{2}[J(J+1) - L(L+1) - S(S+1)]$，于是", "$E(J) - E(J - 1) = AJ$。$A > 0$（正常）对应不足半满的壳层，", "$A < 0$（倒置）对应超过半满的壳层。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由 $\\hat{\\mathbf J} = \\hat{\\mathbf L} + \\hat{\\mathbf S}$ 得 $\\hat{\\mathbf J}^2 =", "\\hat{\\mathbf L}^2 + \\hat{\\mathbf S}^2 + 2\\hat{\\mathbf L}\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf S}$，于是", "$\\hat{\\mathbf L}\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf S} = \\frac12(\\hat{\\mathbf J}^2 - \\hat{\\mathbf L}^2 -", "\\hat{\\mathbf S}^2)$，其在给定 $J$、$L$、$S$ 的态中的本征值为", "$\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2}[J(J+1) - L(L+1) - S(S+1)]$。$J$ 与", "$J - 1$ 的能级差为 $\\frac A2[J(J+1) - (J-1)J] = AJ$。$A$ 的符号在本阶段不加证明地承认：超过半满的", "壳层行为相当于相应数目的正", "空穴。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}